OL,3,A'Feudal' leasehold system set to be
OL,4,Ascrapped in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is to introduce new laws
OL,7,Fto scrap the way flats are built in
OL,8,FEngland and Wales.
OL,10,FUnder the proposed bill, most new
OL,11,Fleasehold flats will be banned and
OL,12,Freplaced with commonhold, where
OL,13,Fresidents collectively own and manage
OL,14,Ftheir buildings.
OL,16,FMatthew Pennycook, the housing
OL,17,Fminister, said the current leasehold
OL,18,Fsystem was "blighting lives" and was an
OL,19,F"anachronism in the twenty-first
OL,20,Fcentury".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
